----

= Trust Recommendations =

You DPS — Stun / Last Resort / Souleater / Drain / Aspir. Souleater = massive enmity, so tank quality matters. Need: Tank, healer, buffs.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Full tank suite — Souleater spikes hate, August's aggressive Provoke spam matters</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Ferreous_Coffin">Ferreous Coffin</a></strong></td><td>Haste on all, **Raise III** (DRK dies from Souleater), status removal on top enmity</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>♥️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/King_of_Hearts">King of Hearts</a></strong></td><td>Haste on melee, Refresh on casters, Phalanx II on August, 40% chance Firaga DPS</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March/Madrigal for your melee, Elegy on mob</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Prishe_II">Prishe II</a></strong></td><td>Pure MNK DPS + emergency Curaga at <25% party HP safety net</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

