= 📋 Endgame Set Cheat-Sheet =

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:140px;">Set</th><th>Pieces</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><strong>TP Build</strong></td><td>Walahra Turban · Hauberk / Ares's Cuirass · Dusk Gloves · Black Cuisses · Aurum Sabatons · Justice Torque · Speed/Swift Belt · Cerberus Mantle +1 · Rajas Ring · Sniper's Ring · Brutal Earring · Assault Earring · Fire Bomblet</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Catastrophe / Cross Reaper / Spinning Scythe WS</strong></td><td>Hecatomb Cap · Hecatomb Harness · Hecatomb Mittens · Hecatomb Leggings · Adaman Breeches · Warwolf Belt · Cerberus Mantle +1 · Flame/Snow/Aqua Gorget · Rajas Ring · Flame Ring · Brutal Earring · Aesir Ear Pendant · Fire Bomblet</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Wheeling/Spinning Slash WS (huge fTP)</strong></td><td>Same as above, but swap **Pallas's Bracelets** or **Alkyoneus's Bracelets** in place of Hecatomb Mittens</td></tr>
